.TH NETSUITE-MAKE-GENERIC-SCHEMA 1 "September 2026" "Qore" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
netsuite-make-generic-schema \- remove account-specific NetSuite schema customizations
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B netsuite-make-generic-schema
.RI [ options ] " input-file output-file"
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reads a NetSuite Swagger JSON schema, removes account customizations and writes
its generic schema as YAML. An existing output file is overwritten.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR -h , " --help"
Display usage.
